    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Edge Buffers</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Apply foam or polyethylene edge buffers on all vulnerable corners of desks, cabinets, and monitor stands. These buffers absorb lateral impacts and prevent chipping of paint or glass. Edge protection is especially critical for high‑value conference tables handled by first flight courier office in Bhandup West.</p>
