    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Custom Wooden Crating</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For oversized or fragile equipment such as server racks, printers, and glass partitions, fabricate a wooden crate that fits the exact dimensions of the item. Line the interior with 10‑mm plywood and add corner braces. This method is the go‑to solution for hire commercial movers seeking maximum rigidity and security.</p>
