    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final Inspection &amp; Sealing</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">After layering, perform a visual and tactile inspection to confirm no gaps or loose sections. Seal each package with reinforced tape and label it with handling instructions such as “Fragile – Keep Upright”. This final step aligns with ISO‑certified movers and packers, guaranteeing that every box meets the highest protection standards.</p>
